{"seq":3,"slug":"transformers-ts","title":"时序 Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/architectures/transformers-ts","wordCount":1441,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"时序-transformer\">时序 Transformer</h1><p>2021 年前后，一批名字里带「former」的模型（Informer、Autoformer、FEDformer）密集涌现，似乎宣告 Transformer 即将统治时序预测。然而 2022 年一篇标题挑衅的论文《Are Transformers Effective for Time Series Forecasting?》给所有人泼了盆冷水：作者发现一个只有一层线性层的 DLinear，在多个长程预测基准上击败了所有这些复杂 Transformer。这场争论没有终结 Transformer，反而逼出了真正适合时序的设计——patching 与通道独立。理解这段「先被质疑再被救活」的历史，是看懂当今时序 Transformer 的钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Transformer 的核心是自注意力：它让序列中任意两个位置直接交互，一步建立长程依赖，彻底摆脱了 <a href=\"rnn-lstm\">循环网络</a> 的串行瓶颈与 <a href=\"tcn-cnn\">TCN</a> 的有限感受野。但把 NLP 的 Transformer 原样搬来并不奏效，时序版本的精髓在几处关键改造。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入序列] --&gt; B[切分 patch&lt;br/&gt;把若干步打包成一个 token]&#10;    B --&gt; C[线性嵌入 + 位置编码]&#10;    C --&gt; D[多头自注意力&lt;br/&gt;任意位置直接交互]&#10;    D --&gt; E[前馈网络 FFN]&#10;    E --&gt; F{通道处理}&#10;    F --&gt;|通道独立| G[每个变量单独建模]&#10;    F --&gt;|通道混合| H[变量间交叉注意力]&#10;    G --&gt; I[预测头]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[H 步预测]\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入序列] --&gt; B[切分 patch&lt;br/&gt;把若干步打包成一个 token]\n    B --&gt; C[线性嵌入 + 位置编码]\n    C --&gt; D[多头自注意力&lt;br/&gt;任意位置直接交互]\n    D --&gt; E[前馈网络 FFN]\n    E --&gt; F{通道处理}\n    F --&gt;|通道独立| G[每个变量单独建模]\n    F --&gt;|通道混合| H[变量间交叉注意力]\n    G --&gt; I[预测头]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[H 步预测]</pre><p>下表对比几种代表性时序 Transformer 的关键设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>关键创新</th>\n<th>注意力对象</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Informer</td>\n<td>ProbSparse 稀疏注意力</td>\n<td>时间步</td>\n<td>降低长序列复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Autoformer</td>\n<td>序列分解 + 自相关机制</td>\n<td>周期</td>\n<td>显式处理趋势季节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PatchTST</td>\n<td>patching + 通道独立</td>\n<td>patch</td>\n<td>长程预测强基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iTransformer</td>\n<td>变量作 token</td>\n<td>变量</td>\n<td>多变量交叉建模</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自注意力-一步直达任意依赖\">自注意力：一步直达任意依赖</h2><p>自注意力的计算把每个位置的表示投影成查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，用查询与所有键的相似度作为权重，对值加权求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Attention</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Attention}(Q,K,V) = \\text{softmax}\\!\\left(\\frac{QK^\\top}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right) V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attention</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4761em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2528em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的意义在于，位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的输出可以直接「看到」位置 1 的信息，路径长度为常数，不像 RNN 要走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 步、也不像 TCN 受感受野限制。代价是计算与内存随序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 呈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 增长，这对动辄上千步的长序列是沉重负担——Informer 的 ProbSparse、Autoformer 的自相关机制都是为降低这一复杂度而生。注意：与 NLP 不同，时序的位置编码尤为关键，因为时序的「顺序」本身就是信号，打乱即失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"patching-把时间步打包成-token\">Patching：把时间步打包成 token</h2><p>PatchTST 带来的最重要改造是 patching。NLP 里一个 token 是一个词，信息密度高；但时序里单个时间步的信息极稀薄，把每一步都当 token，既让序列长度爆炸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 雪上加霜），又让注意力在噪声里打转。patching 借鉴 Vision Transformer 的思路，把连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 个时间步打包成一个 patch 作为 token。这一改动有三重好处：序列长度缩短为原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，注意力计算大幅降低；每个 token 携带一段局部语义（类似局部形态），信噪比更高；模型能看到的历史窗口因此可以拉得很长。patching 已成为现代时序 Transformer 的标配，也是几乎所有 <a href=\"../modern/foundation-models-ts\">时序基础模型</a> 的输入处理范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通道独立-vs-通道混合\">通道独立 vs 通道混合</h2><p>多变量序列有多个通道（变量），如何处理通道间关系是核心设计选择。通道混合（channel-mixing）让模型在通道维度上交互，理论上能利用变量间相关性；但 PatchTST 的一个反直觉发现是：通道独立（channel-independence）——即每个变量用共享权重各自独立建模、完全不看其他变量——反而在许多长程基准上更鲁棒、更不易过拟合。原因在于现实数据的跨变量关系常不稳定，强行建模反成噪声来源。这场「通道独立 vs 通道混合」之争是当今长程多变量预测的主线议题，iTransformer 的回应是把「变量」而非「时间步」当作 token，用注意力专门建模变量间关系，又重新为通道混合扳回一城。完整的对比与最新基准结果见 <a href=\"../modern/multivariate-long-horizon\">多变量与长程预测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"简单模型的反击与启示\">简单模型的反击与启示</h2><p>DLinear 用一层线性层击败复杂 Transformer 的故事，留下的不是「Transformer 无用」的结论，而是几条深刻教训。其一，许多早期时序 Transformer 的「提升」其实来自附带的序列分解与归一化（如 <a href=\"../foundations/preprocessing-features\">预处理与特征工程</a> 中的 RevIN），而非注意力本身。其二，时序基准数据集常常季节性极强、跨变量关系简单，线性模型足以拟合，无法体现复杂模型的价值。其三，评估必须严谨，否则容易制造「进步的幻觉」——这与 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-backtesting\">评估与回测</a> 的主题直接相关。正是这些质疑，催生了 PatchTST、iTransformer 等真正站得住脚的设计，也为 <a href=\"../modern/\">现代方法</a> 一章的基础模型铺平了道路。</p>\n<p>其中「提升来自分解与归一化」这一条最值得亲手验证。下面把一层线性预测与逐序列实例归一化拆成最小可读的伪代码，就能看清 DLinear 为何难缠：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# DLinear 的最小骨架：分解 + 逐序列归一化 + 线性映射&#10;def dlinear_forecast(x_hist, H):          # x_hist: (L,) 一段回看窗口&#10;    mu, sigma = x_hist.mean(), x_hist.std()          # 实例归一化（RevIN 的核心）&#10;    x = (x_hist - mu) / sigma&#10;    trend = moving_average(x, kernel=25)             # 低频趋势分量&#10;    season = x - trend                               # 高频季节残差&#10;    y_trend = W_trend @ trend[-L:]                   # 各自线性映射到 H 步&#10;    y_season = W_season @ season[-L:]&#10;    y = y_trend + y_season&#10;    return y * sigma + mu                            # 逆归一化还原尺度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DLinear 的最小骨架：分解 + 逐序列归一化 + 线性映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dlinear_forecast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x_hist, H):          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># x_hist: (L,) 一段回看窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu, sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x_hist.mean(), x_hist.std()          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实例归一化（RevIN 的核心）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x_hist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    trend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moving_average(x, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 低频趋势分量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    season </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trend                               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 高频季节残差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y_trend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W_trend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trend[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">L:]                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 各自线性映射到 H 步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y_season </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W_season </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> season[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">L:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y_trend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y_season</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu                            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 逆归一化还原尺度</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段骨架里没有任何注意力，只有一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Linear</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Linear}(L \\to H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Linear</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，却因为「显式分解 + 实例归一化」而在许多长程基准上逼近复杂模型——这恰好印证了上面的教训：很多时候是这些工程细节在贡献提升，而非模型复杂度本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自注意力一步建立任意距离依赖，破解了 RNN 串行与 TCN 感受野的瓶颈，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>时序的位置编码与 patching 是关键改造；patching 缩短序列、提升信噪比，已成标配。</li>\n<li>通道独立（PatchTST）与通道混合（iTransformer）之争是长程多变量预测的主线。</li>\n<li>DLinear 的反击提醒：很多提升来自分解与归一化，评估必须严谨。</li>\n<li>现代时序 Transformer 是 <a href=\"../modern/foundation-models-ts\">时序基础模型</a> 的骨架，承上启下。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时序 Transformer","id":"时序-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自注意力：一步直达任意依赖","id":"自注意力-一步直达任意依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"Patching：把时间步打包成 token","id":"patching-把时间步打包成-token"},{"level":2,"text":"通道独立 vs 通道混合","id":"通道独立-vs-通道混合"},{"level":2,"text":"简单模型的反击与启示","id":"简单模型的反击与启示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时序卷积 TCN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/architectures/tcn-cnn"},"next":{"title":"时序基础模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/modern/foundation-models-ts"}}